DOGBERT INSTITUTE FOR ADVANCED THINKING

Dogbert:  "Here in the 'Dogbert Institute for Advanced Thinking,' I have
devised a plan for ending poverty.  My plan is to wait until there are
so many talk shows on television that all the people with wretched lives
can be paid guests."

Dilbert:  "What about the poor people who don't want to be on talk
shows?"

Dogbert:  "We'll get the stragglers on 'Cops.'"

Scott Adams
